# VocabBot for a shared Caddy that loads `import <sites>/*.caddy`.
# scripts/deploy_vps.sh fills in the domain, adds a redirect for every host of
# REDIRECT_FROM and installs it after a validation; Caddy obtains the
# certificates once the domains' A records point at the server.
@DOMAIN@ {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy vocabbot-app:8000
}
